    <string name="privacy_title_data">Your data stays on your phone</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_data">Your collection, decks, portfolio history and settings are stored only in a local database on this device. The app has no account, no analytics, no ads and no servers of its own.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_network">Network use</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_network">The app contacts public card-data sources (by default Pokémon TCG API, Scryfall, YGOPRODeck, Lorcana API, DigimonCard.io and community JSON files hosted on GitHub; you can replace any of these links in Settings) only to download catalogs and prices, and loads card images for display. These requests carry no account or personal data beyond what any web request reveals, such as your IP address. The optional visual engine model is downloaded from the link shown in Settings.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_camera">Camera</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_camera">The camera is used live on your device to read cards with on-device text recognition and image matching. Photos are not saved and never uploaded.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_nearby">Nearby trading</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_nearby">Nearby permissions (Bluetooth, nearby Wi-Fi devices, and location on older Android versions) are used only for device-to-device trading that you start yourself. Your Trade Binder is sent only to a phone you pair with after both of you confirm the code.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_delete">Export and deletion</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_delete">You can export everything to CSV or a JSON backup at any time, free. “Erase all my data” in Settings, or uninstalling the app, removes all data from the device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_trademarks">Trademarks</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_trademarks">This is an independent, unofficial tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any game publisher. Game names and card images belong to their respective owners and are shown only to identify cards. Prices are informational estimates, not financial advice.</string>
