    <string name="section_scan_engine">Scan engine</string>
    <string name="scan_engine_explainer">Optional on-device models that make scanning more precise: YOLO11n finds and straightens the card, PaddleOCR reads its set code, EfficientNet-Lite0 identifies artwork when there is no readable number. Scanning already works without them using ML Kit.</string>
